  "description": "The proposal is to install a three floor stairlift to assist Mrs S M Campbell, the wife and joint owner of the property with the Applicant. \nMrs Campbell has peripheral neuropathy and now requires assistance on stairs. She has a registered disability and is a Blue Badge holder.\nThe stairlift will be fixed to the stair treads, not the walls. When it is no longer required, for example on the sale of property, it can be entirely removed without any damage to the fabric of the building.\nAlthough an alteration to a Listed Building it is a temporary and not a permanent alteration.\nThe supply and installation will be carried out by Kudos Ltd who are the leading supplier of stairlifts in the Greater London area.",
